verdicts: FAIL, FAIL

Two independent reviewers examined slices 02-06 with disjoint lenses and both returned
FAIL. This slice fixes what they found. A third lens (claims verification) has not yet
reported.

Asserts: gates passed -- test 7 held (168 tests), credo 77 held, dialyzer 43 held. The
DB-outage crash, the stdio memory amplification, and the restored sensor test coverage
were each verified by execution before and after.

Does NOT assert: that any reviewer examined THIS diff; that the MCP boundary is secure
(masking is still cosmetic and error responses still leak internals -- both recorded in
BACKLOG.md rather than fixed); or that the ingest path has test coverage. Mutation
testing by the reviewer proved slice 04's else clauses and slice 02's repo-present path
are still uncovered, and this slice did not close that.
